#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 0050:009F"
msgid "Water Titan "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "ask 0050"
msgid "Goodbye. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "ask 0050"
msgid "Hydros? "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "ask 0050"
msgid "I wish the power of Tempestry. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "ask 0050"
msgid "Are you... Hydros? "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0050:01E0"
msgid "Who dares? "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Are you... Hydros? "
msgctxt "bark 0050:02D5"
msgid "Indeed, piteous mortal, I am Hydros. Know that it is into -my- domain that you have trespassed. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Are you... Hydros? "
msgctxt "bark 0050:030E"
msgid "Why do you disturb my rest? "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Are you... Hydros? "
msgctxt "bark 0050:037B"
msgid "And I do not like intrusions. Begone! "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Hydros? "
msgctxt "bark 0050:0436"
msgid "I hope you have come to make amends. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Hydros? "
msgctxt "ask 0050"
msgid "I apologize. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Hydros? "
msgctxt "ask 0050"
msgid "Never! "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Hydros? "
msgctxt "bark 0050:04BA"
msgid "There will be time for conversation when I am free. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Hydros? "
msgctxt "bark 0050:0562"
msgid "I have no desire for idle chatter. Find me when you are worthy of conversation. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I apologize. "
msgctxt "bark 0050:0640"
msgid "Very well, groundling, I accept your submission. Now go and reflect upon my generosity. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I wish the power of Tempestry. "
msgctxt "bark 0050:0798"
msgid "Ah, a wise request from one who has made the difficult journey to my current home. But alas, your desire must go unfulfilled. Trapped here as I am, I cannot help you. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I wish the power of Tempestry. "
msgctxt "ask 0050"
msgid "What can I do? "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I wish the power of Tempestry. "
msgctxt "ask 0050"
msgid "Too bad. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Too bad. "
msgctxt "bark 0050:084D"
msgid "You do not care for my plight? Why, I should... "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Too bad. "
msgctxt "bark 0050:08EE"
msgid "Perhaps I was unclear. You see, should I become free, I would be able to grant you any powers you wish. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Too bad. "
msgctxt "ask 0050"
msgid "I will not help you. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Never! "
msgctxt "bark 0050:098A"
msgid "You do not know what you say, groundling! Begone! "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I will not help you. "
msgctxt "bark 0050:0A4C"
msgid "You do not know what you say, groundling! Begone! "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What can I do? " or "Could you repeat those instructions? "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 0050"
msgid "Could you repeat those instructions? "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What can I do? " or "Could you repeat those instructions? "
msgctxt "bark 0050:0BF2"
msgid "Ah, you will assist me then. My gratitude will be boundless, mortal. The task is a simple one. Merely open the ground next to the gravestone of my captor's beloved, releasing the waters on the cliffside. Do that and I shall be free. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Goodbye. "
msgctxt "bark 0050:0CD6"
msgid "Farewell, my mortal friend. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Goodbye. "
msgctxt "bark 0050:0D07"
msgid "Begone, foolish mortal! "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Goodbye. "
msgctxt "bark 0050:151C"
msgid "Ah, I am now free! Thank you, foolish one, for your actions. Consider my gift of your wretched life as payment for your part. Now I will have my vengeance upon your pathetic kind! I will slay the descendant of my jailer! Let us see who can reach Devon first, groundling. "
msgstr ""
